<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Millipore raised by Morgan.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Millipore raised by Morgan.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it upgraded Millipore Corp to strong buy from neutral.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended Wednesday at 39-1/4.</p>
</text>
